              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "Mobile%20Banking"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "StartFragment\n\n**C1 – Find Support Agents by Complaint Type**\n\n**Method:** GET\n\n**Endpoint:** `/api/support-agents/bycomplaint-type?name=Mobile Banking`\n\n**Query Type:** JPQL\n\n**Description:** Retrieves all support agents assigned to a complaint type by its name. The search is case-insensitive and uses a JOIN between SupportAgent and its complaintTypes collection.\n\n**Test Result:** 200 OK\n\n**Returned Support Agent:** Jean Mugabo\n\n**Complaint Types:** Account and Mobile Banking\n\nEndFragment"
          },
          "response": []
        },
