            "description": "StartFragment\n\n**C2 – Find Free Service Desks**\n\n**Method:** GET\n\n**Endpoint:** `/api/service-desks/free`\n\n**Query Type:** JPQL (NOT EXISTS)\n\n**Description:** Retrieves service desks that are not assigned to any support agent. The results are sorted by desk number in ascending order.\n\n**Test Result:** 200 OK\n\n**Returned Result:** Customer Service Desk 4 (Desk Number 4)\n\nEndFragment"
