            "description": "StartFragment\n\n**D1 – Save Complaint with Validation**\n\nEndpoint: POST `/api/complaints/save`\n\nThis endpoint saves a new customer complaint after validating the complaint date and support agent assignment.\n\n**Business rules:**\n\n1. The complaint date must not be in the past.\n    \n2. A support agent cannot have another complaint assigned on the same date, except when the existing complaint is WITHDRAWN.\n    \n3. Every successfully saved complaint must have status RECEIVED, regardless of the status provided in the request.\n    \n\n**Test results:**\n\n- Valid complaint: Successfully saved with status RECEIVED.\n    \n- Past complaint date: 400 Bad Request.\n    \n- Duplicate support agent and date: 409 Conflict.\n    \n\nEndFragment"
